[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/comments/6421806168","html_url":"https://github.com/yetone/magpie/issues/3696#issuecomment-6421806168","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/3696","id":6421806168,"node_id":"IC_kwDOUns_9M8AAAABfsT8WA","user":{"login":"yinwu01","id":71250493,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjUwNDkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71250493?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinwu01","html_url":"https://github.com/yinwu01","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinwu01/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinwu01/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinwu01/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinwu01/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinwu01/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinwu01/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinwu01/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinwu01/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yinwu01/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-26T16:47:44Z","updated_at":"2026-10-26T16:47:44Z","body":"Problem A is the same as #2883. I have a patch for it on my fork: https://github.com/JoeyWu-tech/magpie/tree/fix/2883-thinking-signature (one commit, d9283c78).\n\naBlock's MarshalJSON now writes `\"signature\": \"\"` for a thinking block that has none, the same way it already writes an empty `thinking`. That one place covers both the filler from withThinkingOnToolTurns and reasoning replayed as unsigned thinking. Signed blocks go out as before, and Claude's own models are never sent unsigned thinking, so nothing changes for them.\n\nIt still applies as is on main 865df247. Its test puts a fake OpenRouter in front that holds `signature` to a string: red with main's anthropic.go (400 \"Invalid Anthropic Messages API request\"), green with the patch. I haven't looked at problem B.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/comments/6421806168/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/comments/6437093743","html_url":"https://github.com/yetone/magpie/issues/3696#issuecomment-6437093743","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/3696","id":6437093743,"node_id":"IC_kwDOUns_9M8AAAABf65Bbw","user":{"login":"yetone","id":1206493,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMDY0OTM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1206493?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yetone","html_url":"https://github.com/yetone","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yetone/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yetone/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yetone/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yetone/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yetone/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yetone/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yetone/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yetone/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yetone/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-27T08:24:15Z","updated_at":"2026-10-27T08:24:15Z","body":"已修复，随 **v0.1.1710** 发布（commit 5f3146be0）。问题 A 的补丁来自 @JoeyWu-tech（coffemon，原本是给 #2883 的），保留其作者署名；问题 B 是合入时补上的。\n\n**A**：magpie 不带签名发出的 thinking 块（工具轮补的那个空格，以及按文本回放的 reasoning）现在都带 `\"signature\": \"\"`，和你抓包里加上这个字段就 200 的结果一致。有签名的块照旧。DeepSeek 自己的 `/anthropic` 端点也接受空签名（2026-10-19 实测过）。\n\n**B**：magpie 本来就会在中转站拒绝消息里的 `output_config`（\"messages.1.output_config: Extra inputs are not permitted\"）时，去掉每条消息上的 `output_config` 再问一次，之后对这个 provider 不再发送；请求顶层的 `output_config` 和 system 消息的文本保留。现在 OpenRouter 的 \"Mid-conversation reasoning effort (configuration_update) is not supported on <model>\" 也走这条路，DeepSeek 和 GLM 都一样。注意这是按 provider 记的，同一个 OpenRouter provider 下的 Claude 模型也不会再收到逐轮的 effort（Claude Code 自己被拒后也是这么做的）。\n\n没有照你的方案把 system 消息改成 user、也没有固定整段对话的 effort：前者会改变对话内容，后者覆盖用户自己的选择；去掉逐轮 effort 已经足以避开这个 400。\n\n**还没处理的一项**：表里 “system 消息、不带 output_config、DeepSeek → 400 Invalid Anthropic Messages API request” 那一行。你的脚注说这是和 A 叠在一起的情况。OpenRouter 这个通用 400 不说是哪个字段，magpie 没法据此判断该改什么，又不至于把 A 那种错误也误判。升级后如果还能遇到，麻烦把那次 400 的完整 body（特别是 `metadata.raw` 里的 path）贴出来。\n\n验证：测试里放了一个按你贴的原文报错的假 OpenRouter（消息上有 `output_config` 就回 Mid-conversation 那条，thinking 没签名就回 Invalid…），用你的最小对话加上 Claude Code 的 system 消息，在 deepseek/deepseek-v4.1-flash-1017 和 z-ai/glm-5.3-flash 上：第二次请求 200，之后的请求第一次就 200。分别手动去掉 A 或 B 的修复，测试都会变红。没有 OpenRouter 账号，没在真的 OpenRouter 上试，麻烦升级后在你那边确认一下。\n","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/comments/6437093743/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/comments/6442605989","html_url":"https://github.com/yetone/magpie/issues/3696#issuecomment-6442605989","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/3696","id":6442605989,"node_id":"IC_kwDOUns_9M8AAAABgAJdpQ","user":{"login":"magicseek","id":446252,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0NjI1Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/446252?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/magicseek","html_url":"https://github.com/magicseek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/magicseek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/magicseek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/magicseek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/magicseek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/magicseek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/magicseek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/magicseek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/magicseek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/magicseek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-27T13:05:16Z","updated_at":"2026-10-27T13:05:16Z","body":"Confirmed on real OpenRouter with v0.1.1734:\n\n- A mid-conversation `role: \"system\"` message carrying a per-message `output_config` (`{\"effort\": \"medium\"}`) previously answered\n\n  ```\n  400 Mid-conversation reasoning effort (configuration_update) is not supported on z-ai/glm-5.3-flash-20260826\n  ```\n\n- On 0.1.1734 the same request answers **200**: the per-message `output_config` is not sent and the request goes through on the first try.\n\nSo problem B is verified fixed for `z-ai/glm-5.3-flash` on a live OpenRouter account. Thanks for the quick turnaround.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/comments/6442605989/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/comments/6620968761","html_url":"https://github.com/yetone/magpie/issues/3696#issuecomment-6620968761","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/3696","id":6620968761,"node_id":"IC_kwDOUns_9M8AAAABiqP3OQ","user":{"login":"ggbdpq","id":67929842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3OTI5ODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/67929842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq","html_url":"https://github.com/ggbdpq","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ggbdpq/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-11-04T02:33:26Z","updated_at":"2026-11-04T02:33:26Z","body":"take","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yetone/magpie/issues/comments/6620968761/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]